        "Id": "quest.ashen_hollow.three_quiet_stones",
        "Title": "The Three Quiet Stones",
        "Summary": "Sel Arien\u0027s guide, Tavar Orr, is caught in the Foldscar - there to be seen, and half a breath out of step with everything. The Quiet Stones around it were turned out of line.",
